OL,3,ABadenoch challenges Burnham over       
OL,4,Auniversity fees for EU students        
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has  
OL,7,Fchallenged Andy Burnham over whether EU
OL,8,Fstudents in the UK could pay lower     
OL,9,Funiversity tuition fees as part of his 
OL,10,Fdeal with the bloc.                    
OL,12,FThe prime minister insisted the issue  
OL,13,Fof tuition fees was "a separate deal", 
OL,14,Fwith discussions on this continuing.   
OL,16,FAsked whether he could rule out EU     
OL,17,Fstudents paying the same fees as       
OL,18,FBritish students, Burnham said this was
OL,19,F"the European negotiating position" and
OL,20,F"won't be put on the table".           
