OL,3,ABadenoch challenges Burnham over       
OL,4,Auniversity fees for EU students        
OL,6,FAt a UK-EU summit last Friday, the two 
OL,7,Fsides agreed a deal covering British   
OL,8,Ffood exports, emissions trading and a  
OL,9,Fyouth travel scheme.                   
